        <section id="what-is-meant-by-a-project&#39;s-critical-path?"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
    <div class="l-media ">
        
        <h2 class="l-media__title">
          What is meant by a project&#39;s critical path?
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <p>“Critical path” is one of the most important of all project management concepts, and it’s something that every project manager should understand before taking the reins of a major project. Put simply, the critical path of a project is a specific sequence of tasks that must be completed on time in order for the project to meet its deadline. Each task on the critical path can only begin after the previous task on the critical path is complete.</p>

      </div>
          <img class="l-media__img" src="~/images/svg/cp3/cp3_u1_s3_p2_image1.svg" alt="" width="300" height="300" >  
    </div>
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
     
    
  
  
